<panel>
  <style>
    .root {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16;
      gap: 6;
      background-color: rgba(0, 10, 21, 0.95);
      border-radius: 12;
      border-color: #00ffff;
      border-width: 2;
      width: 400;
    }
    .title { font-size: 20; color: #00ffff; }
    .section { font-size: 14; color: #ffaa00; margin-top: 4; }
    .info { font-size: 11; color: #aaaaaa; }
    .btn {
      font-size: 14; color: #00ccaa;
      background-color: #001a22; padding: 6;
      border-radius: 6; border-width: 1; border-color: #004444;
      width: 120; text-align: center; margin-top: 8;
    }
  </style>
  <container class="root">
    <text class="title">HOW TO PLAY</text>
    <text class="section">Controls</text>
    <text class="info">Arrow keys or A/D to move</text>
    <text class="info">Space to shoot | P/Esc to pause</text>
    <text class="section">VR Controls</text>
    <text class="info">Right stick to move | Trigger to shoot</text>
    <text class="info">B to pause | Y to pause (left)</text>
    <text class="section">Scoring</text>
    <text class="info">Top: 30 | Mid: 20 | Bot: 10 | UFO: 50-300</text>
    <text class="info">Combos stack multipliers up to x4!</text>
    <text class="section">Boss Waves (every 5th)</text>
    <text class="info">STRIKER - Fast, aimed shots</text>
    <text class="info">BOMBER - Wide spray + bomb drops</text>
    <text class="info">FORTRESS - Heavy shields, tough</text>
    <text class="info">Bosses drop guaranteed power-ups</text>
    <text class="section">Difficulty</text>
    <text class="info">Hard: Aimed bullets + double shots</text>
    <text class="info">Easy: Slower bullets, wider gaps</text>
    <text class="btn" name="btn-tutorial-back">Back</text>
  </container>
</panel>
